Add_Dynamic_Module Graphics Appeal_SDL2_Graphics
Graphics Debug True
Graphics Add_Window Animation_Check "Appeal animation check" 800 600
Graphics Set_GUI_Visible False
Graphics Set_FPS 60
Print (Graphics Load_Animation Adam Standing Examples/Characters/Adam_Movement.png 64 64 0 8)
Print (Graphics Load_Animation Adam Walking Examples/Characters/Adam_Movement.png 64 64 8 8)
Print (Graphics Load_Animation Eve Standing Examples/Characters/Eve_Movement.png 64 64 0 8)
Graphics Set_Animation_FPS Adam Standing 1
Graphics Set_Animation_FPS Eve Standing 2
Graphics Set_Scale Adam 3 3 1
Graphics Set_Scale Eve -3 3 1
Graphics Rotate Adam 0 0 0
Graphics Rotate Eve 0 0 0
Graphics Paste Adam 176 204 0
Graphics Paste Eve 624 204 0
Graphics Render
Print "INITIAL"
Print (Graphics Animation_Frame Adam)
Print (Graphics Animation_Frame Eve)
Delay 1
Graphics Render
Print "ADVANCED"
Print (Graphics Animation_Frame Adam)
Print (Graphics Animation_Frame Eve)
Graphics Set_Animation Adam Walking
Print "WALKING"
Print (Graphics Current_Animation Adam)
Print (Graphics Animation_Frame Adam)
Graphics Reset_Animation Adam
Print "RESET"
Print (Graphics Current_Animation Adam)
Print (Graphics Animation_Frame Adam)
Print "INVALID"
Print (Graphics Load_Animation Adam Bad Examples/Characters/Adam_Movement.png 64 64 39 2)
Print (Graphics Set_Animation Adam Missing)
Print (Graphics Current_Animation Adam)
Graphics Set_Animation_Mode Adam Standing Hold
Graphics Set_Animation_FPS Adam Standing 100
Graphics Render
Delay 1
Graphics Render
Print "HELD"
Print (Graphics Animation_Frame Adam)
Graphics Set_Animation_Mode Adam Walking Reset
Graphics Set_Animation_FPS Adam Walking 100
Graphics Set_Animation Adam Walking
Graphics Render
Delay 1
Graphics Render
Print "RETURNED"
Print (Graphics Current_Animation Adam)
Print (Graphics Animation_Frame Adam)
Graphics Free_Asset Adam
Print "FREED"
Print (Graphics Animation_Frame Adam)
Graphics Close_All
Graphics Add_Window Animation_Check "Reload animation resources" 320 240
Print "RELOADED"
Print (Graphics Load_Animation Adam Standing Examples/Characters/Adam_Movement.png 64 64 0 8)
Graphics Paste Adam 32 32 0
Graphics Render
Graphics Close_All
Print "GRAPHICS_ANIMATION_SDL_PASSED"
Done
